  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T06:49:26.802551Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T07:06:17.887899Z",
  "totalBlocks": 17,
  "translatedBlocks": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2edae6b8cbf9c9da",
      "translationZh": "先说明一下：我参与了这个项目的开发。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d0c16fb64e2e3b1",
      "translationZh": "我们最近开源了 ViiTorVoice-NAR，其中有一项功能，我总觉得它出乎意料地好用：局部语音编辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46be0923f23a972d",
      "translationZh": "想象一下，你有一段录音：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4ca1f12fc219b58",
      "translationZh": "然后，果不其然，录完五分钟后，有人告诉你：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9729369c10df5ae",
      "translationZh": "“其实……是星期二。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd933958e519f039",
      "translationZh": "在常规的 TTS 工作流程中，你可能会重新生成整个句子，然后想办法让新生成的那部分听起来确实能融入原来的录音。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89aae18d2a8e607c",
      "translationZh": "而局部语音编辑的思路是保留原始音频，只重新生成发生变化的部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "399a13ad3652008d",
      "translationZh": "扔掉完好无损的音频 → 全部重新生成 → 祈祷",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5eecb7c4fbf7cf86",
      "translationZh": "以下是我们当前评估中的一些数据：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72bde36629efc829",
      "translationZh": "中文 WER 为 0.99，这大概是让我们盯着结果看了很久、久到自己都觉得可疑的那个数字。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e229eafed85faaf",
      "translationZh": "模型和推理代码均已开源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f4a2dc98a80edb7",
      "translationZh": "我不是来宣称我们已经一劳永逸地解决了 TTS 问题——我们肯定还没有。😅",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f0224113799b064",
      "translationZh": "其实，我更感兴趣的是这里的大家会如何使用编辑功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "041471b65bc8364e",
      "translationZh": "如果不用重新生成整段录音，你会想编辑什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "156ff906a6a818d8",
      "translationZh": "播客？视频？配音？录音后修正某个人的名字？还是某种我还没想到的、完全离谱的用法？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "229cb1271ebf7f78",
      "translationZh": "我真的很想听听大家会拿它尝试些什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0089220c0256efb4",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Important_Drag_6890 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
